B.a8a=s(["Sign up and choose 'Mechanic'.","Fill in your profile: name, experience, services, whether you are mobile or work from a shop, and your warranty if you offer one.","Add your base address (see 'Your base address and how matching works').","Upload any ASE certificates and proof of insurance you have. These are optional but show as badges that help customers choose you.","Set up Stripe so you can be paid (see 'Getting paid: Stripe setup').","Read and sign the Mechanic Agreement."],t.s)
