B.WT=new A.bb("m-start-base","Your base address and how matching works","Why we ask for it, and who sees it.",B.a77)
B.ZX=new A.b_("Payouts go through Stripe. From your dashboard, tap to set up payouts and follow Stripe's steps. Stripe asks for identity and bank details directly. YCYC never sees your bank or card numbers.")
B.YM=new A.b_("Until Stripe finishes verifying you, you may not be able to be paid. Check your earnings screen for any item Stripe still needs.")
B.Yx=new A.dW("If Stripe asks for more information later, complete it promptly. Payouts can pause until you do.")
B.a6f=s([B.ZX,B.YM,B.Yx],t.f)
B.W2=new A.bb("m-start-stripe","Getting paid: Stripe setup","Connect a bank account or debit card through Stripe.",B.a6f)
B.Z8=new A.b_("Upload ASE certificates and proof of insurance in your profile. YCYC reviews them. Approved ones show as badges on your profile and bids.")
B.a8o=s(["Only upload documents that are yours and current.","An insurance badge may disappear when the policy expires. Re-upload the new one.","Never fake or alter a document. It is grounds for permanent removal."],t.s)
B.Xz=new A.ds(B.a8o)
B.a9M=s([B.Z8,B.Xz],t.f)
B.Wp=new A.bb("m-start-badges","Certifications, insurance and your profile badges","Help customers trust you with real documents.",B.a9M)
B.ZV=new A.b_("Open jobs near you appear on your Jobs tab. When a new job is posted near you, you get a notification ('New job near you', or 'New diagnostic request near you'). Tap it to go straight to the job.")
B.Za=new A.b_("Each job shows the vehicle, the problem description, photos, the zip code, and any flags (see 'Flags & labels' for what they all mean).")
B.Y7=new A.dW("The customer's full address is not shown while you are bidding.")
B.a8q=s([B.ZV,B.Za,B.Y7],t.f)
B.W4=new A.bb("m-start-find","Finding jobs","The Jobs tab, notifications, and filters.",B.a8q)
B.a9Z=s(["Open the job and read it carefully, including the flags and photos.","Tap to bid, enter your price and when you can arrive.","Add a note: what is included, parts or no parts, and anything the customer should know.","Submit. You can see your bid on your Bids tab."],t.s)
B.a_l=new A.hj(B.a9Z)
B.YZ=new A.b_("Read 'Bidding rules' before bidding. Honest, complete bids win repeat customers and protect your account.")
B.a63=s([B.a_l,B.YZ],t.f)
B.WV=new A.bb("m-start-bid","Submitting a bid","Price, arrival time, and a short note.",B.a63)
B.ZE=new A.b_("When a customer accepts your bid and pays, their card is held. The job moves to 'In progress'. The customer's full address is then shown to you, along with the arrival time.")
B.Zx=new A.b_("The money is not paid out yet. It is released after the customer confirms the work is complete, or when YCYC releases it as the agreement describes.")
