B.a_8=new A.b_("There is no in-app chat, so show the customer you are coming: tap 'Heading to customer' as soon as you set off, and share your location so they can track you. If you will be very late or cannot make it, cancel as early as you can, before the scheduled time. Cancelling late or not showing up damages your rating and can cost you jobs.")
B.Yu=new A.dW("If you do not show up at all, the customer is not charged and you are not paid. Repeated no-shows can lead to removal.")
B.a6D=s([B.a_8,B.Yu],t.f)
B.Wa=new A.bb("m-incase-late","I am running late","Set off, share your location, or cancel early.",B.a6D)
B.YF=new A.b_("You will see a banner and notification with the new time. You have 48 hours to respond.")
B.a57=s(["Approve: the customer pays the reschedule fee for your stage (20% arrived, 10% on the way, 5% not set off) and confirms the new time.","Decline: the job is cancelled and nobody is charged.","If you do not respond in 48 hours, the request expires."],t.s)
B.Xn=new A.ds(B.a57)
B.Yt=new A.dW("A job can be rescheduled up to three times.")
B.a8R=s([B.YF,B.Xn,B.Yt],t.f)
B.WP=new A.bb("m-incase-reschedule","The customer asks to reschedule","Approve or decline within 48 hours.",B.a8R)
B.a_5=new A.b_("If a customer cancels after paying, a cancellation fee applies (20% before work started, 50% after) and you receive your share. If they cancel before paying, nothing is charged. If they cancel because they felt unsafe, or because they say you asked for off-app payment or changed the price, the job is paused for YCYC to review before any money moves.")
B.a6N=s([B.a_5],t.f)
B.WA=new A.bb("m-incase-cancelled","The customer cancels","You are paid your share of any fee.",B.a6N)
B.a_H=new A.hE("If you are in danger, leave and call 911.")
B.Zl=new A.b_("You never have to continue a job where you feel unsafe. Leave, then report what happened with 'Report a concern' so YCYC can act. Harassment, threats or abuse by a customer are grounds for removal.")
B.aaQ=s([B.a_H,B.Zl],t.f)
B.WG=new A.bb("m-incase-unsafe","I feel unsafe or the customer is abusive","Leave. Call 911 if needed. Report it.",B.aaQ)
B.a8L=s(["Open Earnings and check whether Stripe still needs any information.","Make sure your bank or debit card details are correct in Stripe.","Payouts can take a few business days to appear.","Still stuck? Email rayconsumerlabs@gmail.com with the job and the date."],t.s)
