B.YB=new A.b_("YCYC does not have in-app chat or calling. Your mechanic communicates through job updates, notifications and location sharing. Check the job for those.")
B.a_7=new A.b_("If the scheduled time is coming up and you have heard nothing, you can request a reschedule, or cancel. If you cancel after paying and before work starts, the 20% cancellation fee applies unless the mechanic never shows up.")
