B.a_R=new A.hE("Refunds are not guaranteed. Because of the nature of repair services, a completed or partly completed repair generally cannot be undone, so refunds are treated strictly.")
B.Zu=new A.b_("If a refund is issued, it is at YCYC's sole discretion, based on the evidence provided by you and the mechanic and on the record in the app (photos, notes, location check-ins, confirmations and ratings).")
B.a9C=s(["A refund may be full, partial, or none, depending on what the evidence shows.","If the problem was YCYC's own error, YCYC refunds its fees.","If it was caused by you, YCYC may keep its service fee and may reduce a refund by payment-processing costs.","Cancellation and rescheduling fees follow the rules in the Customer Agreement and are not refunded as a courtesy."],t.s)
B.Xm=new A.ds(B.a9C)
