B.aae=s(["Photos or video of the vehicle before and after, with dates.","The job description, the accepted bid, and any additional work requests, which are all recorded in the app.","The mechanic's progress notes and photos.","Location check-ins (heading to you / arrived), which the app records automatically.","Any invoice or written quote showing what was agreed.","A written opinion from another shop, if you got one."],t.s)
B.XI=new A.ds(B.aae)
