B.Y4=new A.wQ("Look at the whole picture")
B.aaB=s(["Reviews: read several, not just the star average. Look for comments about jobs like yours, honesty, and showing up on time.","Experience: years in the trade and the kind of work they list.","Certifications: ASE certificates that YCYC has reviewed show specific training. They do not guarantee a good result.","Insurance: a mechanic may show an insurance badge. It is information, not a guarantee that any claim will be paid.","Warranty: if a mechanic offers a warranty, ask exactly what it covers and for how long. It is between you and the mechanic.","Mobile or shop: decide whether you want work done at your place or at a shop."],t.s)
