B.alY=new A.fA(2,B.xQ,"Why we exist","Car repair shouldn't be a black box. Too many drivers get overcharged or talked into work they didn't ask for, with nowhere else to turn. YCYC puts that choice back in your hands.",!1,null)
B.alZ=new A.fA(1,B.ya,"Describe what's happening","Tell us about the symptoms. The more detail, the better the bids.",!1,null)
